description: An AI marketing team for a local business. It watches games, concerts, festivals, holidays and weather near each location, matches them to your reusable promotions, and turns the best fits into ready-to-post Instagram campaigns.
entry: index.md
domain: Media
prompts:
  - text: What local events this week fit one of our promotions?
  - text: Turn the top open opportunity into a full Instagram campaign
  - text: Which home games are coming up near our locations?
  - text: Refresh the events calendar for the next three weeks
  - text: What did we learn from our last campaign?
